	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040e"},
		line=858,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How do you find the Imperial Palace after such a long absence, Your Highness?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Your... Highness?)”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The voice I hear beyond the wall chills me to the core.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Could the real Imperial Princess be in the audience chamber right now?",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(To think she was still alive all this time...)”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I would give anything to catch a mere glimpse of Her Highness, yet I cannot will myself to move.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I try to force the strength into my feeble legs, only to collapse into a heap onto the cold floor.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The three long years I've spent until now race through my head in a jumbled mess.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The way I was picked up by Okonogi immediately after the war...",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The way I agreed to play the role of Empress on the condition that he searches for my missing brother...",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"All the ways I masqueraded as Empress Hisui and deceived the Imperial people...",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Born to a noble house of warriors, I now impersonate the Empress and profane the very Imperial Family I was meant to serve.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"This country knows of no more heinous crime.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I am well aware of all this, and yet I could not give up on my love for my brother...",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(I am a sinner beyond all redemption, Onii-sama.)”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Oh, had I only known Her Highness yet lived, I would never have stained my hands with such sin.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I know all too well I'm just making excuses for myself.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Her Highness played no part in it. I and I alone was the one who sold my soul to Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"But still, even still...",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I cannot help but resent her.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We of the Imperial Family have been entrusted with the Empire by Oomikami Himself.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We have a sacred duty to protect the land's harvests and the country's peace in His stead.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As the last survivor of the Imperial Family, I swear that I shall drag you down from the chancellery even at the cost of my life!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Her Highness's resolute voice echoes through the palace.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"This is nothing less than a declaration of war against Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Her Highness intends to fight to the last.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(But... it's too late.)”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The people have been cowed into submission, and their last hope, the Sworn Blades, is no more.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I've even heard rumors that the surviving warriors have all cast aside their blades.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"There are none left who can oppose Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Whatever can you hope to do, Your Highness?)”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"After attending afternoon classes, we arrive at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My, what a lovely establishment!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Kotone lets out a cry of admiration the moment she enters.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“So this marvelous place is where you always take your meals, then?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your Eminence? What finds you here?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Hotori, who was already here, turns around in shock.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I thought it'd be fine to bring her along.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Also, she has some very important news for you.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“B-But...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, let us dine.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, sir. I am positively famished!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Same here. I really worked up an appetite earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"After some time, we finish eating our dinner.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Along with the manager, who joined us partway through, we move to a private, soundproofed room.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So, what's this about Her Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's about the Artifact that Akari has.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We had Kotone appraise it, and the results are in.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Akari and I already heard from Kotone earlier, but we wanted her to be able to tell Hotori in person.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Hearing it straight from the Exalt-Priestess's mouth would be more persuasive than relying on hearsay.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now then, please allow me to present my findings.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Kotone withdraws some scribbled notes from her bag.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Its inscription i",
{"ruby", text="Floral Splendor"},
"s Hana Akari. ",
{"/ruby"},
"It was produced approximately ten and five centuries ago with the lives of thirty priestesses. ”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Its capabilities confer the wearer heightened physical abilities and enhanced resistance to flames, frost, poison, and magicks, among other things.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Hotori remains silent, but she can't hide the astonishment on her face.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Th-That's one extraordinary item.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is most extraordinary indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even a keenblade is produced from five priestesses at most. Thirty is unheard of.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Moreover, I believe the priestesses in question were all hand-picked adepts.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"A mere tool created in exchange for thirty human lives.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"When I imagine the corpses of thirty priestesses lined up side-by-side, it sends a shiver down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“According to the Artifact Registry, Hana Akari was commissioned for the purpose of Empress ",
{"ruby", text="Holly"},
"Hiiragi's",
{"/ruby"},
" campaigns.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It has been worn in countless battles since, conferring untold generations of Empresses protection from the blades of their foes.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It currently still remains in the possession of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To think I was wearing such an incredible Artifact all this time...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Akari trembles at the thought.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, I have been curious for some time now, why might you be in possession of such an Artifact, ma'am?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Cause I'm from the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wait, huh?! Huuuuuuh?!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kotone leaps to her feet and incoherently flaps her mouth like a goldfish.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, guess we forgot to tell you.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? But what of Empress Hisui, then?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She's an impostor set up by Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"This time, even her lips are frozen in place.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"It seems like this was too much of a shock to her system at once.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Kotone-san? Hello? Kotone-saaaan?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Cheep... cheep... cheep.... cheep... cheep...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Seems like she's a goner. I'll go lay her down in the tatami room.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please do.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The manager picks up the unconscious Kotone like a sack of firewood and heaves her out of the room.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Across from us, Hotori lowers her gaze to the certificate of appraisal.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm supposed to believe in Miyaguni's lineage with this?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's just one piece of evidence.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're welcome to still have your doubts, but it'd be foolish to ignore this entirely.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Registry doesn't have any records of it being stolen.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"If an Artifact of this caliber were to be stolen, it would certainly be recorded in the Registry.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Since it hasn't, the natural assumption is that its owner is a member of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We don't expect the Artifact alone to convince you.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I place Akari's cell phone on the table.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This morning, Akari and I went to the Imperial Palace, and we met Okonogi there.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes widen at this.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We recorded our conversation with him.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I hand Hotori a pair of earbuds and play the contents of the recording for her.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"She silently listens from the very beginning.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"But as she listens, she slowly clenches her fists until her knuckles grow white.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The recording is a dismal recounting of how Okonogi killed Empress Suou, created a false Empress, and sold his soul to the Republic in exchange for power.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"It is an unrepentant confession of the greatest crimes ever committed in the history of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Hotori remains silent until the end, only then slowly removing the earbuds from her ears.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The light in her eyes has gone dark, as though her inner fire has been extinguished.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't know what to say.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"She takes a deep breath and stares up at the ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"A single tear runs from her cheek down to her throat.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"For Hotori, the most shocking revelation of all must be that Empress Hisui is an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Hotori is not like me, a warrior who turned a blind eye to the Sworn Blades' oath of fealty.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"She has always been the very embodiment of that fealty, all while carrying the weight of tens of thousands of souls on her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"It would be no exaggeration to say she's had the very bedrock of her convictions dug out from under her.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“During the conversation, Okonogi addresses Akari as\n'Your Highness.'”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's incontrovertible proof of Akari's lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If this is real...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Hotori finally lets out a shaky voice, as if to reject reality itself.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who'd go to all the trouble of making such an elaborate fabrication?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, do you even know any other old geezers that talk like that?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Hotori has no response.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okonogi said too much.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't know why he let you two go, either.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He said it himself, didn't he? He's bored.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He wants to have fun making me suffer.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Hotori maintains her brooding expression.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't this fortuitous news for the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We have the Imperial standard on our side, and Okonogi's confession at our fingertips.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All that's left is to gather our forces and rise up.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you will it to happen, the day we realize our ambitions will soon be upon us.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I know.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Hotori squeezes her eyes shut and restlessly fidgets with her hands.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Her anguish is palpable.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Keep the existence of this recording a secret for a while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have a lot of members that'll take this the wrong way.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"We both know she's thinking about the faction led by Maki Kazuma.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"They're more than a little hot-headed, and they generally\ndon't see eye-to-eye with the more cautious Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Given the slightest pretext, they might decide to stage an immediate uprising and cause a schism within the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades are already low enough on manpower as it is. If we're divided any further, we will have no future.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What say you, Inou? Do you believe me?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I humbly apologize for all my impropriety thus far.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Hotori offers Akari a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"At this, Akari's face glows with elation.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, thank Oomikami! If I've got you on my side, then...”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Hotori interrupts Akari's exclamation with her hand.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry. I'm having trouble sorting through my feelings right now.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I would ask you to wait a few days, that I might figure out what to properly do with myself.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Hotori is having difficulty reconciling the fact that the longstanding object of her fealty has suddenly been revealed to be an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"What's more, she's the head of House Inou and the acting chairman of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Her fealty toward Empress Hisui was undoubtedly second to none.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't come to any rash conclusions.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have no intentions of blaming you.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Hotori bites her lip, looking like she's about to burst into tears at any moment.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Suddenly, a commotion breaks out within the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"When I stick my head out of our private room, I find\neveryone's eyes glued to the television.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It displays Hotori... rather, Natsumi, dancing her heart out in a frilly costume.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"She's just as captivating as ever, but the problem lies in the emergency news ticker scrolling across the bottom of the screen.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"“Her Majesty Empress Hisui set to marry senior Republican cabinet minister”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"“Formal announcement scheduled for March 20th Armistice Day ceremony”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wha...”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"We're all struck speechless.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"But in place of our silence, the warriors filling the restaurant start trading heated remarks.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"“Down with the Republic!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"“Let's not rush to conclusions!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"“Those damn cowards!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"“We gotta stay calm!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The din of the collective shouts is deafening.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Marriage...? What does that even mean...?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“W-When a man and a woman─”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know that! Don't you lose your mind on me too, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I take a deep breath and suppress my agitation.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Suddenly, Okonogi's parting words resurface from the recesses of my mind.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Let me leave you with a piece of interesting news.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Could this be what he was trying to tell us?",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"If this marriage goes through, it will be even harder for Imperials to defy the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"To do so would require turning one's blade against the homeland of the emperor-consort.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"If a future comes where their heir accedes to the Imperial throne, the Empire and the Republic would truly be united as one.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It is intolerable for the Imperial line to be sullied by foreign blood!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That would be the ultimate defeat.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Such a marriage would defile a sacred line of succession that has remained unbroken for over two thousand years.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"But what can we possibly do to stop it?",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"If we resort to violence, the outcome will be no different than if we assassinated Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"As I bite my lip with frustration, Hotori takes to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Back to headquarters, now.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We need to stop Maki from going rogue.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's probably a good idea.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"We have no time to waste.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, can you head back home with the manager?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Got it. Be careful, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let us meet again.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Hotori offers a deep bow to Akari, before deftly fastening her blade to her hip.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Hotori and I make a beeline towards the Sworn Blades Headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"As you might expect from a street full of restaurants, I can hear arguments coming from all over the place.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"A column of military vehicles passes in front of us.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Quite a few of them, at that.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like the Army is on high alert.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we make a move in a situation like this, we'll be like moths to a flame.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, jeez, what do we even do? My head's a mess...”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Hotori absently ruffles her hair.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Suddenly, a car pulls up right in front of us.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Where might the two of you be headed at this hour?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"The student council president emerges from the back seat.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're taking a walk.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I really do hope it's just a walk.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"She says with a sharp glare at me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Her expression is completely different from one she would show us at school.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"It's a countenance entirely unbefitting a friendly title like “student council president.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I hear the sound of intermittent bursts of gunfire in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This evening is going to be a long one.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It would be best if you two head home soon.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I pray that we do not cross paths again tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Her car sets off before we can get a word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What terrible timing.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now we definitely can't make a move tonight.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
